WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
Get some air conditioners first

2
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:05,630
Boss, this way

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,120
Boss, there is one here

4
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,550
Boss, there are more here

5
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,390
How many water machines do you want?

6
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,390
This is a commercial value water machine

7
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:18,750
Can be directly connected to water pipes

8
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,750
It has multiple filters inside and can also produce hot water.

9
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:28,300
In the current environment, it is definitely a good thing. There are still a few and five of them. All of them are good.

10
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,780
Get two and put them in the lobby

11
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,300
At that time, the charging standards will be the same as those for water heaters.

12
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,300
Isn’t this another opportunity for lettuce?

13
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,940
If there are other similar things, please help me get them.

14
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:38,960
There is a store selling toilets in front of you

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:44,990
They are all integrated with automatic induction. Do you want them? Are they expensive? Then go ahead.

16
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,510
Pay attention to the most expensive one. I want to put it in my room.
